<title>UK: Toyota unit sets A$150 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Toyota unit sets A$150 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOYOTA FINANCE AUSTRALIA</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  TOYOTA MOTOR CORP NETHERLANDS BV</p>
<p> AMT    A$150 MLN     COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    03.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.665   PAY DATE    03.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
